to create ansible vault:
ansible-vault create playbookname.yml

to decrypt ansible vault playbook:
ansible-vault decrypt playbookname.yml

to encrypt ansible vault playbook:
ansible-vault encrypt playbookname.yml

to  edit ansible vault playbook:
ansible-vault edit playbookname.yml

to view ansible vault playbook:
ansible-vault view playbookname.yml

to change the password:
ansible-vault rekey playbookname.yml

to execute the vaultplaybook:
sudo ansible-playbook playbookname.yml --ask-vault-pass
